 REWRITE-UI.md                     |  1 +
 WeaselUI/DirectWriteResources.cpp | 10 ++++++-
 WeaselUI/RewriteLayout.h          | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 WeaselUI/WeaselPanel.cpp          | 18 ++++++++-----
